{
  "id": "E407",
  "title": "Trading Stocks",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-03-07",
  "synopsis": "Little Zhang’s friend has two million now through trading stocks! Does that mean he’s really successful?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50407/028e98bec1995dcbdc0277f501b375e3a205e7d1.mp3?1582295789",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "炒股票\n\n小张：我朋友喜欢炒股票。现在他有两百万了。\n小何：这么厉害！他是不是很会炒股票？\n小张：我想他不太会。\n小何：为什么？\n小张：一个月前，他有五百万。\n",
    "traditional": "炒股票\n\n小張：我朋友喜歡炒股票。現在他有兩百萬了。\n小何：這麼厲害！他是不是很會炒股票？\n小張：我想他不太會。\n小何：為什麼？\n小張：一個月前，他有五百萬。\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Trading Stocks"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小张：我朋友喜欢炒股票。现在他有两百万了。",
      "traditional": "小張：我朋友喜歡炒股票。現在他有兩百萬了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng wǒ péng you xǐ huan chǎo gǔ piào xiàn zài tā yǒu liǎng bǎi wàn le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: My friend likes trading stocks. Now he has two million."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：这么厉害！他是不是很会炒股票？",
      "traditional": "小何：這麼厲害！他是不是很會炒股票？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé zhè me lì hai tā shì bú shì hěn huì chǎo gǔ piào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: That’s so awesome! Does he know well how to trade stocks?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小张：我想他不太会。",
      "traditional": "小張：我想他不太會。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng wǒ xiǎng tā bú tài huì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: I don’t think he’s that good at it."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小何：为什么？",
      "traditional": "小何：為什麼？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé wèi shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Why?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小张：一个月前，他有五百万。",
      "traditional": "小張：一個月前，他有五百萬。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng yí ge yuè qián tā yǒu wǔ bǎi wàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: A month ago, he had five million."
    }
